    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d702">

                <pb facs="0942" n="832" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg832"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.1153 St 2/20</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Blair</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received January 19.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 719</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to the Embassy’s
                    despatch No. 713 of December 26th, 1927,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d702-f1"/> and to
                    submit a further report on the Petroleum Monopoly. At the beginning of the week,
                    a reply was received to the Embassy’s <hi rendition="#italic">Note Verbale</hi>
                    of December 23rd, 1927,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d702-f2"/> a copy of which was
                    transmitted with the above mentioned despatch, and I am transmitting herewith
                    copies of the Spanish text of this note together with the Embassy’s translation.
                    …</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Percy Blair</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d702-a1.xml" xpointer="d702-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
